, outside, back of toilet, toilet base, plumbing pipes, flush handles, and flush mechanisms.","source":"captured_current_form"},{"id":"restroom.service.08","label":"Clean baby changing stations","description":"Fold the station down and clean the inside, outside, handles, straps, hinges, and wall area around it. Close the station when finished.","source":"captured_current_form"},{"id":"restroom.service.09","label":"Clean partitions, walls, and doors","description":"Wipe fingerprints, splashes, handles, locks, push plates, kick plates, and any visible marks.","source":"captured_current_form"},{"id":"restroom.service.10","label":"Sweep the floor","description":"Get behind toilets, under dispensers, corners, edges, and around trash cans.","source":"captured_current_form"},{"id":"restroom.service.11","label":"Mopped","description":"Always use clean mop water, especially for the final mopping. Wring the mop out well and leave no standing water.","source":"captured_current_form"},{"id":"restroom.service.12","label":"Final check","description":"Restroom should look clean, smell clean, be stocked, and have no trash, streaks, puddles, or missed spots.","source":"captured_current_form"},{"id":"restroom.service.floor_to_ceiling_deep","label":"Floor-to-ceiling deep cleaning completed, including corners, walls, cobwebs, vents, and fixtures","description":null,"source":"corrected_v17_screen_12_13_preserved_under_OC24"},{"id":"restroom.service.stainless","label":"Stainless steel surfaces cleaned and polished","description":null,"source":"corrected_v17_screen_12_13_preserved_under_OC24"},{"id":"restroom.service.dispensers_cleaned","label":"Toilet tissue, paper towel, and soap dispensers cleaned","description":null,"source":"corrected_v17_screen_12_13_preserved_under_OC24"},{"id":"restroom.service.hand_dryer","label":"Hand dryer cleaned","description":null,"source":"corrected_v17_screen_12_13_preserved_under_OC24"},{"id":"restroom.service.toilet_tissue_restocked","label":"Toilet tiss